{"seq":1,"slug":"forecast-accuracy-shared","title":"共享预测准确率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/forecast-accuracy-shared","wordCount":1837,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享预测准确率度量\">共享预测准确率度量</h1><p>协同做完一轮，双方都会问同一个问题：这个预测准不准？这个问题看起来简单，但如果不先把口径钉死，答案会自相矛盾——平台说 SKU 层 MAPE 是 34%，工厂说按料号算误差翻了一倍，两边都没说谎，只是量的是不同的东西。</p>\n<p>准确率不是预测的一个属性，而是「<strong>某个版本、某个聚合层级、某个提前期</strong>上的预测」的属性。度量体系要做的第一件事，就是把这四个坐标固定下来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-度量对象的四个坐标\">核心概念：度量对象的四个坐标</h2><p>任何一个准确率数字，只有带上这四个坐标才有意义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>坐标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本</td>\n<td>哪个冻结版本</td>\n<td><code>FC-2026W40-003</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级</td>\n<td>在哪个聚合层级度量</td>\n<td>料号层 / 品类层 / 供应商汇总层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前期</td>\n<td>发布时距目标周几周</td>\n<td>提前 4 周 / 提前 12 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口</td>\n<td>度量的时间范围</td>\n<td>滚动 26 周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二篇<a href=\"../forecast-supplier-decompose/forecast-confidence-share\">预测口径与置信度共享</a>已经建立了误差观测表，它的主键正是 <code>(supplier_id, supplier_part, version_id, horizon_weeks)</code>——四个坐标里的三个已经在里面了。这一篇要补上的是层级这个坐标，以及由它引出的一个反直觉现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合层级决定准确率-这不是矛盾\">聚合层级决定准确率：这不是矛盾</h2><p>同一个预测，在料号层看得很糟、在品类层看却很好，这种情况非常普遍。原因不是数据出错，而是聚合在数学上会抑制随机误差：多个序列的独立误差在加总时部分抵消，因此聚合层的相对误差通常小于底层。</p>\n<p>以 MAPE 为例，它在底层可能因为大量零值而爆炸（<a href=\"https://otexts.com/fpp3/accuracy.html\">MAPE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时无定义或无穷，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近零时产生极端值</a>），而在品类层因为分母变大、零值罕见，数值立刻变得温和。所以「我们的 MAPE 是 12%」这句话如果没有指明层级，几乎必定会引发争议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"度量指标的选择\">度量指标的选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>跨序列可比</th>\n<th>零值友好</th>\n<th>适用层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{mean}(\\lvert e_t\\rvert)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单序列绝对误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\text{mean}(e_t^2)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.282em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.958em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.918em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.282em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单序列，重罚大误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAPE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mn>100</mn><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{mean}(\\lvert 100 e_t / y_t\\rvert)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(∣</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>品类层及以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MASE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{mean}(\\lvert q_j\\rvert)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 用 naïve MAE 缩放</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>料号层默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSSE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\text{mean}(q_j^2)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.6635em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1765em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1365em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6635em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>料号层，重罚大误差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论很清楚：<strong>料号层用 MASE/RMSSE，品类层及以上可以用 MAPE，供应商汇总层用 MASE</strong>。同一个看板上并列两种指标时，必须在标签里写明层级，否则读者会以为它们可比。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分层准确率：同一批误差观测，按三个聚合层级分别汇总&#10;CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW forecast_accuracy_layered AS&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT o.supplier_id, o.supplier_part, o.version_id, o.horizon_weeks,&#10;         o.forecast_qty, o.actual_qty,&#10;         abs(o.actual_qty - o.forecast_qty) AS abs_err,&#10;         -- naïve 缩放因子：按料号在观测窗口内的平均绝对周环比变化&#10;         nullif(avg(abs(o.actual_qty - o.prev_actual)) OVER w, 0) AS naive_mae&#10;  FROM forecast_accuracy_obs o&#10;  WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY o.supplier_id, o.supplier_part)&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#39;part&#39;   AS level, supplier_id, supplier_part, version_id, horizon_weeks,&#10;       avg(abs_err / naive_mae) AS mase, count(*) AS n&#10;FROM base GROUP BY 2,3,4,5&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT &#39;supplier&#39; AS level, supplier_id, NULL, version_id, horizon_weeks,&#10;       avg(abs_err / naive_mae), count(*)&#10;FROM base GROUP BY 2,4,5;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分层准确率：同一批误差观测，按三个聚合层级分别汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MATERIALIZED VIEW forecast_accuracy_layered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">horizon_weeks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abs_err,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- naïve 缩放因子：按料号在观测窗口内的平均绝对周环比变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prev_actual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> naive_mae</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast_accuracy_obs o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WINDOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'part'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, supplier_id, supplier_part, version_id, horizon_weeks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(abs_err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> naive_mae) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mase, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supplier'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, supplier_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, version_id, horizon_weeks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(abs_err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> naive_mae), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>视图把两个层级并列输出，是为了让「同一批预测在不同层级的准确率差多少」成为一个随时可查的事实，而不是每次争议时重新算一遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估的四个常见陷阱\">评估的四个常见陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"陷阱一-用协调后的数字去评估\">陷阱一：用协调后的数字去评估</h3><p>第 1.1 篇的协调步骤会调整基础预测。评估时用的是基础预测还是协调后的预测，结果不同。正确做法是<strong>两者都记录</strong>：基础预测的准确率反映的是模型能力，协调后预测的准确率反映的是外发给供应商的那个数字的实际表现。对协同有意义的是后者，但前者是诊断协调步骤是否过度的依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱二-忽略间歇需求\">陷阱二：忽略间歇需求</h3><p>间歇性需求（很多周为零、偶尔有大额）会让 MAPE 完全失效，也会让 naïve 缩放因子趋近于零从而让 MASE 爆炸。对这类料号，要么单独归类不进总体指标，要么用分组指标（如以 4 周为窗口的累计误差）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱三-提前期混池\">陷阱三：提前期混池</h3><p>把一个料号所有提前期的误差混在一起算平均，会掩盖一个关键事实：提前 12 周的预测误差可能是提前 2 周的 3 倍。混池之后的平均值介于两者之间，对谁都不具指导性。这就是误差观测表把 <code>horizon_weeks</code> 放进主键的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱四-样本不足时给出结论\">陷阱四：样本不足时给出结论</h3><p>一个新料号只有 6 周历史，算出 MASE 0.4 就宣布「预测很准」是不成立的。度量输出必须带样本量，并在样本量低于阈值时明确标注为「观测不足」。上表的 <code>n</code> 列就是为此设计的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补充-错误定义本身也要对齐\">补充：错误定义本身也要对齐</h3><p>误差的定义是「观测值减预测值」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{T+h}=y_{T+h}-\\hat{y}_{T+h|T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，符号方向决定了偏差是正还是负（<a href=\"https://otexts.com/fpp3/accuracy.html\">Forecasting: Principles and Practice</a>）。外发给供应商时如果不写明符号约定，「偏差 -8%」会被对方理解成低估或高估两种相反的意思。惯例是<strong>实际减预测</strong>，正数表示预测偏低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级的可加性-一个必须处理的矛盾\">层级的可加性：一个必须处理的矛盾</h2><p>准确率在层级之间<strong>不可加</strong>，但业务需要汇总。品类层准确率不是其下料号准确率的平均，也不能用加权平均还原——因为聚合抑制了误差。处理这个矛盾的标准做法是：<strong>每个层级的准确率都从原始误差观测重新计算</strong>，而不是从下层指标向上合成。上表的视图正是这么做的：两个层级都从 <code>base</code> 出发独立聚合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[误差观测表&lt;br/&gt;supplier_id + part + version + horizon] --&gt; B[基础预测误差]&#10;  A --&gt; C[协调后预测误差]&#10;  B --&gt; D[料号层指标&lt;br/&gt;MASE / RMSSE]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[品类层指标&lt;br/&gt;从原始观测重算]&#10;  D --&gt; F[供应商汇总层指标&lt;br/&gt;从原始观测重算]&#10;  E --&gt; G[外发共享&lt;br/&gt;带层级标签 + 样本量]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{样本量足够?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[标注「观测不足」]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[进入协同效果评估]\">graph TD\n  A[误差观测表&lt;br/&gt;supplier_id + part + version + horizon] --&gt; B[基础预测误差]\n  A --&gt; C[协调后预测误差]\n  B --&gt; D[料号层指标&lt;br/&gt;MASE / RMSSE]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[品类层指标&lt;br/&gt;从原始观测重算]\n  D --&gt; F[供应商汇总层指标&lt;br/&gt;从原始观测重算]\n  E --&gt; G[外发共享&lt;br/&gt;带层级标签 + 样本量]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{样本量足够?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[标注「观测不足」]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[进入协同效果评估]</pre><h2 id=\"共享哪些数字给供应商\">共享哪些数字给供应商</h2><p>不是所有指标都该外发。给供应商的准确率应该满足两个条件：一是他能理解（MASE 需要解释，分层 MAPE 不需要），二是他据此能行动。</p>\n<p>务实的做法是外发三样：<strong>料号层 MASE</strong>（看整体准不准）、<strong>按提前期分层的偏差</strong>（看系统性地偏多还是偏少，直接决定他备多少料）、以及<strong>趋势</strong>（最近 8 周是否在改善）。第三样最容易被忽略，但对信任的建立最重要——一个数字是 0.72 还是 0.95，供应商无从判断好坏；但「从 0.95 改善到 0.72」这个走向，他能立刻理解并据此决定要不要加深协同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>准确率不是预测的属性，而是「某版本 + 某层级 + 某提前期 + 某窗口」的属性；缺少任一坐标的数字都不具可比性。</li>\n<li>聚合会抑制随机误差，因此同一预测在料号层与品类层的指标可以差很多，这不是矛盾而是数学性质；各层级的指标必须从原始误差观测独立重算，不能向上合成。</li>\n<li>指标选择按层级分工：料号层用 MASE/RMSSE（零值友好、跨序列可比），品类层及以上可用 MAPE，MAPE 在料号层因零值而失效。</li>\n<li>四个陷阱：用协调后数字评估（应两者都记）、忽略间歇需求、提前期混池、样本不足下结论。</li>\n<li>外发给供应商的应包含料号层 MASE、按提前期分层的偏差、以及改善趋势——趋势决定了供应商是否愿意加深协同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：准确率的改善最终要落到运营指标上，两者之间的归因方法见<a href=\"stockout-overstock-improve\">缺货率/库存周转改善</a>；准确率与承诺达成率一起构成供应商协同绩效的输入，见<a href=\"supplier-collab-score\">供应商协同绩效评分</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享预测准确率度量","id":"共享预测准确率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：度量对象的四个坐标","id":"核心概念-度量对象的四个坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合层级决定准确率：这不是矛盾","id":"聚合层级决定准确率-这不是矛盾"},{"level":3,"text":"度量指标的选择","id":"度量指标的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"评估的四个常见陷阱","id":"评估的四个常见陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱一：用协调后的数字去评估","id":"陷阱一-用协调后的数字去评估"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱二：忽略间歇需求","id":"陷阱二-忽略间歇需求"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱三：提前期混池","id":"陷阱三-提前期混池"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱四：样本不足时给出结论","id":"陷阱四-样本不足时给出结论"},{"level":3,"text":"补充：错误定义本身也要对齐","id":"补充-错误定义本身也要对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"层级的可加性：一个必须处理的矛盾","id":"层级的可加性-一个必须处理的矛盾"},{"level":2,"text":"共享哪些数字给供应商","id":"共享哪些数字给供应商"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预测偏差/缺货风险预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/collab-exception-alert"},"next":{"title":"缺货率/库存周转改善","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/stockout-overstock-improve"}}